<br><br>Membership entitles you to buy additional wine via the website, or direct from our winery at a members’ discount of 20%.  In addition, you will also get privileged access to reserve and limited edition wines at a 20% discount (subject to availability and allocation). You will also receive invitations to members events in London, Hong King or Lisbon as well as VIP tours and tastings at the vineyard and winery in Portugal.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kpDprT ifeEKM pf-90_"><button type="button" class="sc-imWZod yQSGW pf-91_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="b2c81098-ac2e-4ee9-8738-37b6262318cb" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Shipping</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="b2c81098-ac2e-4ee9-8738-37b6262318cb" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-jXbVAB fMPMgo pf-93_"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-94_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-95_"><p class="sc-feopBa gVincu pf-96_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-98_">We ship to most places in Portugal, the UK and Hong Kong.<br><br>There may be a small additional charge to ship to some rural locations. We are unable to ship to PO Box addresses.For shipping to other countries, please Contact Us for more information.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kpDprT ifeEKM pf-99_"><button type="button" class="sc-imWZod yQSGW pf-100_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="ac2e2ee9-0738-47b6-a623-18cb2a39f6cf" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Amount of Wine</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="ac2e2ee9-0738-47b6-a623-18cb2a39f6cf" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-jXbVAB fMPMgo pf-102_"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-103_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-104_"><p class="sc-feopBa gVincu pf-105_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-107_">You will receive 12 bottles of wine with each wine club shipment. You may also order additional cases of wine or choose to take advantage of our special offers of reserve and premium wines. Order quantities will vary, depending on the offer.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kpDprT ifeEKM pf-108_"><button type="button" class="sc-imWZod yQSGW pf-109_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="70d2d59a-4f8b-42aa-ab15-8ab8fb9072b1" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>EUR €0 Initiation fee / EUR €0 Cancellation fee</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="70d2d59a-4f8b-42aa-ab15-8ab8fb9072b1" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-jXbVAB fMPMgo pf-111_"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-112_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-113_"><p class="sc-feopBa gVincu pf-114_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-116_">No extra fees here. You only pay for the wine that is delivered directly to your door, at a 20% member discount. In addition to your initial order of a case of wine, as a member of the club you are signing up for a minimum of two additional shipments before you can cancel.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="